    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost &amp; Found Collection is an immersive, PSX-style horror game where each VHS tape you discover unveils a unique story within the same eerie universe. Set in different but interconnected locations and timelines, each tape offers a fresh narrative and new mysteries to explore, drawing you deeper into the dark secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Stories:</strong> Every VHS tape contains a self-contained story, all within the same universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding Content:</strong> New tapes with fresh stories will be added over time, expanding the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro PSX-Style Visuals:</strong> Experience a nostalgic, pixelated horror aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Gameplay:</strong> Engage in tense, story-driven gameplay, rich in mystery and suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, uncover the truth, and dive into a chilling journey where every tape brings you closer to the heart of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
